<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2447491d7027> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Police in the city of Ningbo have taken corrective action after the facial recognition system at a crosswalk mistakenly accused famous businesswoman Dong Mingzhu of jaywalking because she appeared in an ad on a passing bus." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5069" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8485ab1443c5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Police in the city of Ningbo have taken corrective action after the facial recognition system at a crosswalk mistakenly accused famous businesswoman Dong Mingzhu of jaywalking because she appeared in an ad on a passing bus." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5069" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9a55cf4665bc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A camera at an intersection in the eastern city of Ningbo named famous businesswoman Dong Mingzhu as a jaywalker after catching her face on the side of passing bus, Chinese tech site Abacus reported." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "521" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08838a239017> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It also said the surveillance system would be completely upgraded to cut incidents of false recognition in future." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/38730bc9b19b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "While China has moved ahead of the rest of the world making facial recognition technology or the AI-backed cameras a part of everyday life, they are still not perfect." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4ab5a71412a4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Cities like Beijing and Shanghai were amongst the first to employ the AI system to help regulate the traffic and identify drivers who violate the road rules." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "503" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d126a7e53624> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Many now rely on automatic camera-based systems that take pictures of people as they cross roads or mingle with traffic." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1174" .

